+<style>body{max-width:1500px;margin:28px auto;padding:0 20px;background:#080f16;color:#f1f4f3;font:17px system-ui}h1,h2{font-weight:600}p,figcaption{color:#a4bac7}a,summary{color:#ffd348}img{display:block;width:100%;border-radius:7px}figure{margin:24px 0}figcaption{padding:10px 0}summary{cursor:pointer}.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(360px,1fr));gap:20px}</style>
+<h1>Wash required stays over the showroom</h1><p>Actual native App captures using isolated dirty-Forklift records. The compact prompt replaces the full sidebar, and the four camera buttons are removed.</p>
+<figure><img src="test_garage_sidebar-gl_compatibility/app-dirty-forklift-overlay.png" alt="Dirty Forklift with compact wash overlay and no view buttons"><figcaption>Actual App · dirty Forklift · full showroom width.</figcaption></figure>
+<figure><img src="test_garage_sidebar-gl_compatibility/app-wash-after-shortcut.png" alt="Actual washing after the touch shortcut"><figcaption>Touch Wash car opens manual washing without a sidebar.</figcaption></figure>
+<details><summary>Original task-start layout</summary><figure><img src="fixtures/garage_wash_overlay_before/test_clean_before-gl_compatibility/wash-required-kits.png" alt="Original wash-required sidebar and view buttons"><figcaption>Exact task-start sources reloaded only inside the isolated baseline process.</figcaption></figure></details>
+<div class="grid"><figure><img src="test_garage_clean_customisation-gl_compatibility/wash-required-livery-960.png" alt="Compact wash requirement at 960"><figcaption>Small window: prompt and action fit.</figcaption></figure><figure><img src="test_garage_clean_customisation-gl_compatibility/clean-kits-unlocked.png" alt="Clean car with editing unlocked"><figcaption>Actual washing still unlocks the existing workbench.</figcaption></figure></div>
+<details><summary>Desktop Mobile / Vulkan</summary><figure><img src="test_garage_sidebar-mobile/app-dirty-forklift-overlay.png" alt="Forklift overlay on Vulkan"></figure></details>
+<p>UI/shortcut checks: 549 per desktop renderer. Gesture checks: 65 per renderer. The broader cleanliness suite retains one Forklift film assertion, also reproduced on the original runtime; its assertions and thresholds are unchanged.</p>
+<p><a href="report.json">Actual commands, results and hashes</a> · <a href="task-only.patch">Scoped checkpoint</a></p><p>Client reload and owner visual/touch acceptance remain. No physical-device test was performed.</p></html>
